note The keys, read in the frame before the tree is built and turned into actions: first the palette's chord, and while the palette is open and has the keyboard every key goes to it (feature-palette); then the Save chord, back and forward, every field fed the frame's edits and typed text, then the arrows: while the Graph view is shown and the graph holds the keyboard (the last press was inside its canvas) each arrow is a GraphWalk, otherwise up and down walk the path when no field has the keyboard. Which chord does what comes from the feature registry through keys.

